n has been in operation  for several hundreds of years but even  they are starting to fill the push of  the divinity as less people pray and  offer to the old ones like the Tawaf a--  who guard their  of Maratha from the outside realms a  delicate balance has been upset the  coven led by mother Silas creates Tatia  mother Silas has her own motivations  wrapped up in all of this which are  later to be revealed  Talia's journey is at the heart of my  story it's about someone who is  struggling against a destiny that's been  laid out for them Tatia is really young  and a bit naive at first but very  intuitive and there are very powerful  forces at work at all times  Tatia begins to discover who she is at a  time in which witchcraft has been  outlawed and disposable by death the  current King Gideon the first commands  an order known as the ash makers led by  Lord ash maker shodhan the purpose of  the ash makers is to essentially stamp  out any remnants of the old world and  spread fear about witchcraft especially  many things have been set in motion  around Tatia and she is the centerpiece  as the story continues she discovers  more of them there is a bit of a Truman  Show element her life might not entirely  be her own the ash maker is a right to  some extent witchcraft can be a danger  the sisters of the coven actually took a  great risk in the creation of Tatia not  fully knowing where it could lead and  there are other powers at play beyond  the barrier which the two off the guard  Baylor and his minions to the filmora  press on the borders from the other  world Talia is a horror story based in  mythology told in graphic novel form  drawn by the amazing Matthew Eldon we  are launching the campaign in June so  that you get notified immediately when  the book is available for order get put  on the mailing list all my links are in  the description  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  it was midnight and the silk glow of the  half moon caressed the face of Maratha  there was a 